  "instructions": [
    "In a large stockpot, combine beef bones, onion, ginger, star anise, cinnamon stick, and cloves. ",
    "Add water to the stockpot and bring to a boil over high heat. ",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 1 hour. ",
    "Strain the broth through a fine-mesh sieve into a clean pot and discard the solids. ",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together fish sauce, soy sauce, and sugar. ",
    "Add the mixture to the broth and stir to combine. ",
    "Bring the broth to a simmer and cook for 5 minutes. ",
    "Cook rice noodles according to package instructions and set aside. ",
    "To assemble the Pho, place a portion of noodles in a bowl, add sliced beef or pork and a sprinkle of bean sprouts, and pour the hot broth over the top. ",
    "Serve with lime wedges, fresh cilantro, and your choice of sriracha, hoisin sauce, and chopped scallions.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
  ],
